<title>USA: Harleysville sets up reinsurance program.</title>
<headline>Harleysville sets up reinsurance program.</headline>
<dateline>HARLEYSVILLE, Pa. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harleysville Group Inc said on Wednesday that it established an internal catastrophe reinsurance program that would cost the company about $0.03 a share per quarter.</p>
<p>The reinsurance program is aimed at stabilizing Harleysville Group earnings by transferring some of the risk to Harleysville Mutual Insurance Co for a price.</p>
</text>
